\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Hierarchical coefficients and mesh block means}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{On the hierarchical precision of \ref{fdip-009A}, block means
return a precision of the same shape, with coefficients
#{c'_i=pc_{i+1}}. For every #{B\ge 4}, \ref{fdip-00BT} gives a
nonzero precision entry at some distance at least #{2}. The two
calculations concern different precisions.}
